    "text": "Only for IESS affiliates. The IESS sickness subsidy pays 75% of wages from the fourth day of illness, after a minimum of six months of contributions; maternity pays 75% for 12 weeks. — Runa HR explainer, May 2026, citing the Social Security Law. Secondary; the 1978 IESS rule (C.S. Informal workers get none of this, nor the 13th and 14th salary bonuses, paid vacation or severance. — *Primicias*, 2024.",
    "mark": "care",
    "keys": []
