    "text": "SNAP reached about 612,700 Coloradans a month (FY2025, 10.2%); maximum $1,023/month for a family of four from Oct 2026. — USDA FNS via USAFacts; *Colorado Politics*. Free school meals at 1,803 schools. See.",
