   "h": "Handle with care (adults first)",
   "items": [
    "Extortion, absent or deported parents, immigration status, and violence at home are present in families students meet. **Never ask a family about them.** These questions go to Center staff.",
    "Do not ask Venezuelan or Colombian families about their papers. Do not ask anyone whether a relative went the Darién way.",
    "Do not use security stories to make the trip feel dangerous or brave."
   ]
